msgid "``lens_corr()`` zoom is now functional *(behavior)*"
msgstr "El zoom de ``lens_corr()`` ahora es funcional *(behavior)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:201
msgid ""
"``image.lens_corr()`` now actually applies its ``zoom`` argument (it was "
"previously parsed but ineffective), so output differs for scripts that "
"passed a non-default zoom. Re-check ``lens_corr()`` tuning."
msgstr ""
"``image.lens_corr()`` ahora aplica realmente su argumento ``zoom`` (antes se"
" analizaba pero era inefectivo), por lo que la salida difiere para los "
"scripts que pasaban un zoom no predeterminado. Vuelve a revisar el ajuste de"
" ``lens_corr()``."

