msgid "For a clean port to v2.1.0 the typical work is:"
msgstr "Para una migración limpia a v2.1.0, el trabajo típico es:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:214
msgid ""
"Replace ``image.FREAK`` with ``image.ORB``, drop the descriptor-type "
"argument, and update ``match_descriptor()`` tuple unpacking / "
"``draw_keypoints()`` to the keypoints object (:ref:`the ORB rework "
"<v2_1_0_orb>`)."
msgstr ""
"Reemplaza ``image.FREAK`` por ``image.ORB``, elimina el argumento de tipo de"
" descriptor y actualiza el desempaquetado de tupla de ``match_descriptor()``"
" / ``draw_keypoints()`` al objeto de puntos clave (:ref:`el rediseño de ORB "
"<v2_1_0_orb>`)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:218
msgid ""
"Rename ``sensor.set_whitebal()`` / ``set_gain_ctrl()`` / "
"``set_exposure_ctrl()`` to the ``set_auto_*`` forms (:ref:`the auto-function"
" rename <v2_1_0_autofuncs>`)."
msgstr ""
"Renombra ``sensor.set_whitebal()`` / ``set_gain_ctrl()`` / "
"``set_exposure_ctrl()`` a las formas ``set_auto_*`` (:ref:`el renombrado de "
"funciones automáticas <v2_1_0_autofuncs>`)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:221
msgid ""
"Move histogram/statistics code to the object methods (:ref:`the "
"histogram/statistics rework <v2_1_0_histogram>`)."
msgstr ""
"Mueve el código de histograma/estadísticas a los métodos de objeto (:ref:`el"
" rediseño de histograma/estadísticas <v2_1_0_histogram>`)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:223
msgid ""
"Rename ``find_features()`` ``scale=`` to ``scale_factor=`` (:ref:`the "
"find_features rename <v2_1_0_findfeatures>`)."
msgstr ""
"Renombra ``scale=`` de ``find_features()`` a ``scale_factor=`` (:ref:`el "
"renombrado de find_features <v2_1_0_findfeatures>`)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:225
msgid ""
"Use blob-object accessors and replace ``find_markers()`` with "
"``find_blobs(merge=True, ...)`` (:ref:`the find_blobs change "
"<v2_1_0_findblobs>`); replace ``img.copy_to_fb()`` with the ``copy_to_fb=`` "
"keyword (:ref:`the copy_to_fb change <v2_1_0_copytofb>`)."
msgstr ""
"Usa los accesores del objeto de mancha (blob) y reemplaza ``find_markers()``"
" por ``find_blobs(merge=True, ...)`` (:ref:`el cambio de find_blobs "
"<v2_1_0_findblobs>`); reemplaza ``img.copy_to_fb()`` por la palabra clave "
"``copy_to_fb=`` (:ref:`el cambio de copy_to_fb <v2_1_0_copytofb>`)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:230
msgid ""
"Clamp ``compress()`` quality to 1–100 and re-check JPEG sizes on the OpenMV "
"3 (:ref:`the compress change <v2_1_0_compress>`); re-tune ``lens_corr()`` "
"zoom (:ref:`the lens_corr change <v2_1_0_lenscorr>`)."
msgstr ""
"Recorta la calidad de ``compress()`` a 1–100 y vuelve a revisar los tamaños "
"JPEG en el OpenMV 3 (:ref:`el cambio de compress <v2_1_0_compress>`); "
"reajusta el zoom de ``lens_corr()`` (:ref:`el cambio de lens_corr "
"<v2_1_0_lenscorr>`)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:234
msgid "All other scripts run unchanged."
msgstr "Todos los demás scripts funcionan sin cambios."
